## Unresponsive script dialog

dom-slow-script-dialog-title = Avís: hi ha un script que no respon
dom-slow-script-dialog-message = Un script d'aquesta pàgina està ocupat, o pot haver deixat de respondre. Podeu aturar-lo ara, o continuar i veure si acaba.
# Variables:
#   $location (String) - URL of the script, followed by a colon and the line number (e.g. “https://example.com/script.js:42”). Long URLs are shortened with an ellipsis in the middle.
dom-slow-script-dialog-location = Script: { $location }
# The & character marks the access key of the checkbox label.
dom-slow-script-dialog-dont-ask-again = No m'ho tornis a &demanar
dom-slow-script-dialog-stop-button = Atura l'script
dom-slow-script-dialog-continue-button = Continua
dom-slow-addon-script-dialog-title = Avís: hi ha un script de complement que no respon
